/E (Sponsors can host specific challenges during the hackathon. These challenges can be designed to incorporate the sponsor's API or products, or simply bear the sponsor's name and relate to their industry. Hosting a challenge allows sponsors to see firsthand how students can creatively apply their products and technologies, potentially uncovering new and unique use cases. Alternatively, sponsors can opt to judge a prize category, choosing the winner of the category and potentially including one of their products as a prize.)
